      "text": "30332 / B\u00FCt\u00E7e Kalemi Baz\u0131nda Miktar/Tutar\nSe\u00E7imi ve Giri\u015F Kural\u0131",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "30332 / B\u00FCt\u00E7e Kalemi Baz\u0131nda Miktar/Tutar Se\u00E7imi ve Giri\u015F Kural\u0131",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZdD8W-mUcLplRlGEjU63I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2709.1111740838896,
      "y": 2270.119047619048,
      "width": 1691.0157470703127,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ae",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1802178749,
      "version": 124,
      "versionNonce": 1385392627,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787212724797,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Her b\u00FCt\u00E7e kalemi i\u00E7in miktar bilgisi olmayabilir. Zorunlu olarak o b\u00FCt\u00E7e kaleminin miktar m\u0131 tutar m\u0131\noldu\u011Fu se\u00E7tirilmeli ve giri\u015F ekran\u0131nda da ona g\u00F6re bilgi g\u00F6sterilmeli. b\u00FCt\u00E7e giri\u015Finde miktar bilgisi\ngirilebilmelidir. E\u011Fer tan\u0131mla ekran\u0131nda miktar bilgisi yoksa b\u00FCt\u00E7e giri\u015Finde miktar bilgisi\ngirilmemelidir.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Her b\u00FCt\u00E7e kalemi i\u00E7in miktar bilgisi olmayabilir. Zorunlu olarak o b\u00FCt\u00E7e kaleminin miktar m\u0131 tutar m\u0131 oldu\u011Fu se\u00E7tirilmeli ve giri\u015F ekran\u0131nda da ona g\u00F6re bilgi g\u00F6sterilmeli. b\u00FCt\u00E7e giri\u015Finde miktar bilgisi girilebilmelidir. E\u011Fer tan\u0131mla ekran\u0131nda miktar bilgisi yoksa b\u00FCt\u00E7e giri\u015Finde miktar bilgisi girilmemelidir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
