    {
      "id": "8108deoka1VeXMvCBWYJ_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2544.5624912806907,
      "y": 4374.726190476189,
      "width": 1944.803588867188,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b02",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1686922397,
      "version": 73,
      "versionNonce": 1495847933,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787213410671,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B\u00FCt\u00E7e listesinde \u002B bas\u0131p g\u00F6rd\u00FC\u011F\u00FCm\u00FCz sayfada b\u00FCt\u00E7e ger\u00E7ekle\u015Fme ve kalan alanlar\u0131nda b\u00FCt\u00E7e yap\u0131lan y\u0131l\u0131n bir\nsonraki y\u0131l\u0131 kapsayacak \u015Fekilde de\u011Ferleri g\u00F6rmelidir. Ayn\u0131 \u015Fekilde tarihler de o \u015Fekilde g\u00F6stermelidir. 2026 eyl\u00FCl\n2028 aral\u0131k i\u00E7in veri giri\u015Fi yap\u0131ld\u0131. \u0130lgili s\u00FCtunlarda d\u00F6nem ba\u015Flang\u0131c\u0131\u002B1 y\u0131l mant\u0131\u011F\u0131nda g\u00F6sterim yap\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B\u00FCt\u00E7e listesinde \u002B bas\u0131p g\u00F6rd\u00FC\u011F\u00FCm\u00FCz sayfada b\u00FCt\u00E7e ger\u00E7ekle\u015Fme ve kalan alanlar\u0131nda b\u00FCt\u00E7e yap\u0131lan y\u0131l\u0131n bir sonraki y\u0131l\u0131 kapsayacak \u015Fekilde de\u011Ferleri g\u00F6rmelidir. Ayn\u0131 \u015Fekilde tarihler de o \u015Fekilde g\u00F6stermelidir. 2026 eyl\u00FCl 2028 aral\u0131k i\u00E7in veri giri\u015Fi yap\u0131ld\u0131. \u0130lgili s\u00FCtunlarda d\u00F6nem ba\u015Flang\u0131c\u0131\u002B1 y\u0131l mant\u0131\u011F\u0131nda g\u00F6sterim yap\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
