      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787213586900,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B\u00FCt\u00E7e listesi k\u0131sm\u0131nda \u002B eklenen yerde hesap kodu b\u00FCt\u00E7e kodu yerine gelecek. Hesap plan\u0131\nhesap ad\u0131 \u015Feklinde gelecek.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B\u00FCt\u00E7e listesi k\u0131sm\u0131nda \u002B eklenen yerde hesap kodu b\u00FCt\u00E7e kodu yerine gelecek. Hesap plan\u0131 hesap ad\u0131 \u015Feklinde gelecek.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hFJHsXz-ZV6QmUl5wKwsj",
      "type": "text",
