    {
      "id": "ISGpS0wmJiG0OEKXv2iHj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2520.7410016741064,
      "y": 5849.428571428571,
      "width": 1979.4703776041665,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 117578611,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 416680723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787213696619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B\u00FCt\u00E7e listesi ekran\u0131nda, alt b\u00FCt\u00E7elere ait detay k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131n g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClenebilmesi gerekmektedir. Mevcut \u201CDetay\u201D\nbutonu bo\u015F oldu\u011Fu i\u00E7in fonksiyonu anla\u015F\u0131lmamaktad\u0131r. Bu alanda, detay g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClemeye ek olarak \u201C\u002B\u201D \u00F6zelli\u011Finin\nkullan\u0131lmas\u0131 ve alt b\u00FCt\u00E7elerin k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131m baz\u0131nda g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClenebilmesi daha uygun olacakt\u0131r.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B\u00FCt\u00E7e listesi ekran\u0131nda, alt b\u00FCt\u00E7elere ait detay k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131n g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClenebilmesi gerekmektedir. Mevcut \u201CDetay\u201D butonu bo\u015F oldu\u011Fu i\u00E7in fonksiyonu anla\u015F\u0131lmamaktad\u0131r. Bu alanda, detay g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClemeye ek olarak \u201C\u002B\u201D \u00F6zelli\u011Finin kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 ve alt b\u00FCt\u00E7elerin k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131m baz\u0131nda g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClenebilmesi daha uygun olacakt\u0131r.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
